Ever think about whom the ��middle class�� are that all of the politicians talk about. Can the ��middle class�� be clearly defined? The early days of our country, before we gained our independence, there were all kinds of classes. There were the upper class, royalty, the ruling class, the high class, the low class, and as Rodney Dangerfield once said, ��call me when you have no class.��
